Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: blueberry-pie-os-kernel
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Priority: required
Depends: base-files (>= 0-1), kext-tools
Breaks: blueberry-pie-os-boot (<< 1.3)
Description: the xnu kernels for the Pi 4 and Pi 5, for the boot partition
 xnu's DEVELOPMENT kernels for the BCM2711 and BCM2712, in one bundle that
 pieboot loads, with the kexts the kernel loads first: the networking,
 serial and FAT families and the board's drivers.

Package: blueberry-pie-os-kernel-dev
Architecture: darwin-arm64
Section: devel
Description: files for building kexts against the kernels
 The kernel SDK's headers and libcc_kext, and each kernel's System.kext,
 for building kexts with pietoolchain's kext.mk.
